    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Notes",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Data source:** the modem's own web API (`/dm/tr98/?objs=...`), read by the exporter after logging in as the web UI does. No SNMP or TR-069 access is needed.\n\n**Optical values** are reported by this firmware as whole numbers (e.g. `-16` dBm), so small changes are not visible. **Traffic rates** come from byte counters, so they are real bits/sec. Short spikes are smoothed by the 5-minute `rate()` window."
      }
